			<zone xml:id="p2z31-0" points="604,3120 661,3139 855,3120 887,3149 1001,3117 1157,3146 1157,3028 1131,3019 1023,3022 963,3076 855,3035 798,3069 756,3028 677,3069 604,3054">621,3111 648,3111 675,3111 702,3111 729,3111 756,3111 783,3111 811,3111 838,3111 865,3110 892,3108 919,3108 946,3108 973,3108 1001,3108 1028,3108 1055,3108 1082,3107 1109,3106 1136,3105 1164,3105</zone>
